OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786843096
OL,3,CTetraplegic taking on 79-mile Great
OL,4,CGlen Way in off-road wheelchair
OL,6,FA tetraplegic veteran is taking on a
OL,7,F79-mile journey in his off-road
OL,8,Fwheelchair to prove that life goes on
OL,9,Fand can still be "extraordinary".
OL,11,FDanny Mavor, who served in the Royal
OL,12,FScots Dragoon Guards in Iraq, was
OL,13,Fparalysed from the neck down after a
OL,14,Fmotorcycle accident six years ago.
OL,16,FHe is now based at Erskine Hospital.
OL,26,@qD@ROUqD@`O]
