PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786843096
OL,3,CTetraplegic taking on 79-mile Great
OL,4,CGlen Way in off-road wheelchair
OL,6,FThe 41-year-old, from Glasgow, is
OL,7,Fpreparing to travel across Scotland
OL,8,Falong the Great Glen Way using a chin-
OL,9,Fcontrolled wheelchair in a major
OL,10,Fendurance challenge next month.
OL,12,FThe journey will take Mr Mavor from
OL,13,FFort William to Inverness over three
OL,14,Fdays, raising funds for people living
OL,15,Fwith spinal injuries through the
OL,16,Fcharity Regain.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786843096
OL,3,CTetraplegic taking on 79-mile Great
OL,4,CGlen Way in off-road wheelchair
OL,6,FIt will push him to his physical and
OL,7,Fmental limits, but he said he wants to
OL,8,Fhelp support other tetraplegics who
OL,9,Fare facing similarly life-changing
OL,10,Fspinal injuries.
OL,12,F"All my life, I've always enjoyed that
OL,13,Ffeeling of a challenge," Mr Mavor told
OL,14,Fthe Press Association.
OL,16,F"You break your neck and your previous
OL,17,Flife is kind of history ` who you
OL,18,Fwere, what you were, everything you
OL,19,Fidentified as ` there's a lot to get
OL,20,Fover."
OL,26,@tD@AOUuD@XO]xD@AOU|D@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786843096
OL,3,CTetraplegic taking on 79-mile Great
OL,4,CGlen Way in off-road wheelchair
OL,6,FHe said he wants to struggle on this
OL,7,Fchallenge because he believes sitting
OL,8,Fstill is slowly killing him.
OL,10,FMr Mavor said he struggles day to day
OL,11,Fwith pain that he has felt since the
OL,12,Fmoment he broke his neck.
OL,14,F"It intensifies when I'm doing things
OL,15,Flike this (or when) I'm talking about
OL,16,Fthe past, but it also gives me a
OL,17,Flittle bit of a buzz thinking about my
OL,18,Fold life," he said.
OL,26,@vD@AOUwD@KpmwD@SpnzD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786843096
OL,3,CTetraplegic taking on 79-mile Great
OL,4,CGlen Way in off-road wheelchair
OL,6,F"I just know that I'm struggling
OL,7,Fanyway, so why not do the things that
OL,8,FI loved, like mountains, like a
OL,9,Fchallenge, like hanging out and
OL,10,F(enjoying) camaraderie with the boys?"
OL,12,FMr Mavor previously said attempting 25
OL,13,Fmiles a day through Scottish terrain
OL,14,Ffeels somewhere between "inspiring and
OL,15,Fabsolutely idiotic".
OL,17,FThere will be at least two or three
OL,18,Fobstacles throughout the journey where
OL,19,FMr Mavor will need to use harnesses
OL,20,Fand rely on his support team to
OL,21,Ftraverse steep inclines.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@ApmrD@JpnrD@fO]vD@YOUwD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786843096
OL,3,CTetraplegic taking on 79-mile Great
OL,4,CGlen Way in off-road wheelchair
OL,6,F"The path is going to be walkable, and
OL,7,Fdrivable in a wheelchair," he said.
OL,9,F"It's going to be bobbly, it's going
OL,10,Fto be bumpy, and I'm going to have a
OL,11,Fvery sore chin."
OL,13,FHe added: "This chair is all-terrain,
OL,14,Fand that's great, but there's still
OL,15,Fbumps ` like stones and just little
OL,16,Fcambers, things like that that are all
OL,17,Fgoing to make a huge difference to the
OL,18,Fstart and the end of each day."
OL,20,FHe said Regain is a charity close to
OL,21,Fhis heart.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@ZO]qD@AOUsD@PO]uD@KOUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
