PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786843096
OL,3,CTetraplegic taking on 79-mile Great
OL,4,CGlen Way in off-road wheelchair
OL,6,FIt is dedicated to improving the
OL,7,Findependence, mobility, and quality of
OL,8,Flife for individuals living with
OL,9,Ftetraplegia.
OL,11,FMr Mavor's fundraising page can be
OL,12,Ffound at www.justgiving.com/page/
OL,13,Fdannys-big-challenge-2026.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
